<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Getty Communications.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Getty Communications.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robertson Stephens &amp; Co analyst Keith Benjamin said he raised his rating on Getty Communications Plc to a buy from a long-term attractive. He cited &quot;powerful underlying growth trends and significant business leverage.&quot;</p>
<p>--Getty provides visual content to various businesses, including advertising and design agencies, magazine, book and new media publishers.  &quot;We believe industry growth can accelerate as more companies incorporate pictures into communication,&quot; Benjamin said in a statement.</p>
</text>
